, MAPP, MuTA, and MuTA/S with different regions.</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead><tr><th align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><th align="center" colspan="3" rowspan="1">Lysozyme</th><th align="center" colspan="3" rowspan="1">LacI</th></tr><tr><th colspan="7" align="left" rowspan="1"><hr/></th></tr><tr><th align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Benign</th><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Deleterious</th><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Prediction Accuracy</th><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Benign</th><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Deleterious</th><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Prediction Accuracy</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">SIFT</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">864/1377</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">169/175</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">79.66</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1764/2267</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">767/1166</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">71.80</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">MAPP</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">826/1377</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">170/175</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">78.57</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1795/2267</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">834/1166</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">75.35</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">MuTA</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">790/1377</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">169/175</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">76.97</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1819/2267</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">762/1166</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">72.79</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">R1</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" col